      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><blockquote><p>Searching for tags when creating new topics does not match tags midword</p></blockquote><p>I was just caught by that here:</p><p><oembed url=\"https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/need-a-low-power-tag-167008\"></oembed></p><p> </p><p><strong><u>PS</u>:</strong></p><p>It also means you can’t select the MCU family by just typing, say, “F0” - you have to do the full “STM32F0”.</p><p>That’s a bit superfluous.</p></div>"
